This submission contains a single LaTeX source file (main.tex) with embedded
bibliography and five PDF figure files in the figures/ subdirectory.

Compilation:
  pdflatex main.tex
  pdflatex main.tex

The bibliography is embedded directly in main.tex (no separate .bib file needed).

Files included:
  main.tex                             - Main LaTeX source (self-contained)
  figures/fig1_equity_vs_alpha.pdf     - Figure 1: Equity vs federal cost-share
  figures/fig2_relocation_by_income.pdf - Figure 2: Relocations by income group
  figures/fig3_regional_heterogeneity.pdf - Figure 3: Regional heterogeneity
  figures/fig4_policy_comparison.pdf   - Figure 4: Policy alternatives comparison
  figures/fig6_game_structure.pdf      - Figure 5: Game structure diagram

Required packages (all standard in TeX Live):
  amsmath, amssymb, amsthm, graphicx, booktabs, natbib, geometry,
  hyperref, xcolor, float, subcaption, setspace, mathptmx, algorithm,
  algpseudocode

Recommended TeX Live version: 2023 or later

IMPORTANT REVISIONS IN THIS VERSION:
- Corrected citation years: Elliott et al. (2020), Greer & Binder (2017),
  Binder & Greer (2016), Bullard (2005)
- Updated author affiliation: Department of Industrial Engineering
- Standardized American English spelling throughout
- Improved academic writing style per journal standards
- Enhanced clarity and readability of abstract and introduction
- All figures verified for quality and resolution
